\item[S2] W. K. Hayman and E. F. Lingham, Research Problems in Function Theory (2018), Problem 6.107, complete problem and update, harmonic-class notation preceding Problem6.103. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.07200}.
\item[S3] S. Ponnusamy and A. Sairam Kaliraj, On the Coefficient Conjecture of Clunie and Sheil-Small on Univalent Harmonic Mappings (2014), Section1, pp.1--2, definitions of $S_H$, $S_H^0$, and harmonic Jacobian. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1403.5619}.
